    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        ConfTuner: <span class="search-hit mathjax">Training</span> Large Language Models to Express Their Confidence Verbally
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+Y">Yibo Li</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Xiong%2C+M">Miao Xiong</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wu%2C+J">Jiaying Wu</a>, 
      
