      <span class="abstract-full has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="2508.15617v1-abstract-full" style="display: none;">
        Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">models</span> (LLMs) excel in text generation; however, these creative elements require heavy computation and are accompanied by a steep cost. Especially for targeted applications such as sales and marketing outreach, these costs are far from feasible. This paper introduces the concept of &#34;Trained Miniatures&#34; - Small <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>(SLMs) fine-tuned for specific, high-value applications, generating similar domain-specific responses for a fraction of the cost.
